WEBVTT

00:00:01.968 --> 00:00:05.768
The beginning breeze

00:00:06.239 --> 00:00:10.039
Delivers this message

00:00:10.477 --> 00:00:19.044
"Because I have always believed in you"

00:00:20.186 --> 00:00:20.653
The Story of Saiunkoku

00:00:20.653 --> 00:00:28.762
The Story of Saiunkoku
We are standing in the land
we dreamed of back then

00:00:28.762 --> 00:00:29.057
The Story of Saiunkoku

00:00:29.295 --> 00:00:36.565
We feel weak at the knees a little,
gazing over the scenery

00:00:36.803 --> 00:00:40.933
But please don't look back

00:00:41.074 --> 00:00:45.101
Because you've decided to go forward

00:00:45.311 --> 00:00:49.407
I looked up into the sky to see
the rainbow with seven colors

00:00:49.682 --> 00:00:53.118
Can you see it too?

00:00:53.386 --> 00:00:57.288
The beginning breeze

00:00:57.690 --> 00:01:01.421
Delivers this message

00:01:01.861 --> 00:01:10.030
I will watch over you as
you go forth to chase your dreams

00:01:10.403 --> 00:01:18.606
The dancing winds in the blazing sun

00:01:19.045 --> 00:01:28.716
Fly forth strongly
with the wings of freedom

00:01:39.232 --> 00:01:41.598
Hey, Ryushin! Wait!

00:01:43.736 --> 00:01:47.399
Catch me if you can!

00:01:47.674 --> 00:01:50.905
Darn it! Today, you've gone too far!
I will not forgive you!

00:01:50.977 --> 00:01:55.573
It's one thing to forget your homework,
but doodling on the temple's walls?!

00:01:55.748 --> 00:01:59.582
Despite the winter cold,
Shurei had reason to be heated.

00:01:59.652 --> 00:02:02.143
This happened after
she took the aptitude test...

00:02:02.222 --> 00:02:04.952
...and before the results
were released.

00:02:05.825 --> 00:02:08.316
Hey! What are you doing?

00:02:09.429 --> 00:02:10.418
Ryushin.

00:02:10.497 --> 00:02:13.489
Can you make it over here,
Miss Shurei?

00:02:15.201 --> 00:02:16.964
You said it.

00:02:17.036 --> 00:02:20.802
Ah, hey! Stop it!
This is too hard for you!

00:02:20.874 --> 00:02:22.775
Just you wait there!

00:02:22.775 --> 00:02:24.766
I-I'm telling you
it's too hard!

00:02:27.547 --> 00:02:29.674
Teacher!

00:02:30.316 --> 00:02:35.276
There's No Medicine for Lovesickness

00:02:36.556 --> 00:02:38.183
You've caught a cold.

00:02:38.258 --> 00:02:40.556
Jumping into a river
in the middle of winter?

00:02:40.627 --> 00:02:43.858
I'm just glad your heart
didn't stop beating.

00:02:45.665 --> 00:02:48.395
I wonder how many years it's been
since I last caught a cold?

00:02:49.836 --> 00:02:54.273
I'll make you a warm drink
and an ice pack...

00:02:54.340 --> 00:02:56.501
...so please wait a moment.

00:03:01.514 --> 00:03:04.483
Sorry, I'm being childish.

00:03:10.790 --> 00:03:13.816
I'll stay with you, so please,
get some sleep.

00:03:15.228 --> 00:03:18.561
Seiran, your hand is cold
but it feels good.

00:03:27.373 --> 00:03:29.341
Sei-raaa...

00:03:30.743 --> 00:03:33.906
I told you to rest quietly.

00:03:33.980 --> 00:03:35.675
You have a fever...

00:03:35.748 --> 00:03:38.876
...so stop rolling around,
and pull up the covers over you.

00:03:39.485 --> 00:03:42.750
Saying such things
to such a young child?

00:03:42.922 --> 00:03:45.891
You're sure an interesting
fellow, Seiran.

00:03:46.693 --> 00:03:48.752
Madam, what about her medicine?

00:03:48.828 --> 00:03:50.193
It's right here.

00:03:50.263 --> 00:03:54.131
But Shurei really has
taken to you, hasn't she?

00:03:55.368 --> 00:03:59.270
M-Madam,
wh-what are you doing?

00:04:00.440 --> 00:04:04.137
I told you to stop looking so sullen.

00:04:04.210 --> 00:04:07.873
It's such a waste to have
a cute face looking like that.

00:04:16.489 --> 00:04:18.980
What's this about Shurei
being sick?!

00:04:19.692 --> 00:04:21.159
Master.

00:04:21.227 --> 00:04:24.663
Weren't you going to spend the
night at the archives? And what's that?

00:04:27.567 --> 00:04:29.535
Why am I carrying these things?!

00:04:30.169 --> 00:04:32.330
But we have to keep her warm
with covers.

00:04:32.405 --> 00:04:36.865
And we need nourishing food and, right!
An ice pack! Huh?

00:04:37.310 --> 00:04:41.610
Why do we keep her warm
yet cool her down?

00:04:41.681 --> 00:04:44.617
- Please calm down, Master.
- Ah, yes. You're right.

00:04:44.617 --> 00:04:45.743
Calm down.

00:04:46.986 --> 00:04:52.481
It's been so long since someone was
sick here, so I was really surprised.

00:05:08.608 --> 00:05:10.701
Oh, Seiran.
I'll take care of that.

00:05:11.944 --> 00:05:14.378
Master! Are you all right?!

00:05:14.447 --> 00:05:16.915
- I'll take care of this.
- What's going on?

00:05:17.250 --> 00:05:19.684
Oh, Shurei.
Are you feeling all right?

00:05:19.752 --> 00:05:21.049
Y-Yeah.

00:05:21.587 --> 00:05:23.350
Wait just a moment.

00:05:23.423 --> 00:05:26.324
I'll go make you
some special ginger tea.

00:05:27.293 --> 00:05:30.785
Father! It's okay. I'm all right.

00:05:31.130 --> 00:05:32.995
It's not a problem.
You rest.

00:05:33.066 --> 00:05:36.297
Once you drink this, your cold
will be blown away in an instant.

00:05:37.537 --> 00:05:39.471
If you do that...

00:05:39.539 --> 00:05:41.063
...the whole kitchen
will be blown away.

00:05:41.541 --> 00:05:43.771
Seiran. Stop Father.

00:05:43.843 --> 00:05:47.802
If this house falls apart any more,
we'll have no place to live.

00:05:48.281 --> 00:05:51.045
I understand.
So please get some rest.

00:05:52.785 --> 00:05:54.184
M-Master!

00:05:59.258 --> 00:06:02.989
Come to think of it, I sort of recall
this happening in the past.

00:06:07.867 --> 00:06:09.994
Madam, what did
you have her drink?!

00:06:10.069 --> 00:06:13.664
She's always complaining, "It's bitter!
It's bitter!" so I made it sweet.

00:06:14.674 --> 00:06:16.005
This is too sweet!

00:06:16.075 --> 00:06:20.011
Shoka just smiled
and said it was sweet.

00:06:21.314 --> 00:06:25.751
Come to think of it, Shoka said
he'd make some ginger tea.

00:06:34.927 --> 00:06:36.792
Now, let's see.

00:06:37.029 --> 00:06:39.998
Huh? Where could it be?

00:06:40.666 --> 00:06:42.793
He hasn't changed one bit.

00:06:43.503 --> 00:06:44.470
Excuse us.

00:06:46.672 --> 00:06:51.200
No one answered when we called,
so we decided to come right in.

00:06:51.811 --> 00:06:56.874
Shoka dashed home immediately
when he heard that Shurei was ill.

00:06:57.517 --> 00:07:00.008
We brought medicines and vegetables
that help fight the illness.

00:07:00.086 --> 00:07:04.386
Well, hello General Ran and Koyu.

00:07:04.791 --> 00:07:07.157
Did you come to visit Shurei?

00:07:10.296 --> 00:07:14.630
I was just making some ginger tea,
but I can't find the ginger.

00:07:14.700 --> 00:07:18.568
Can't ginger it up
with no ginger, can you?

00:07:21.007 --> 00:07:22.975
Pretend you didn't hear that.

00:07:23.843 --> 00:07:26.971
Master, we'll take care
of everything now...

00:07:27.046 --> 00:07:28.911
...so please go back
to her ladyship.

00:07:28.981 --> 00:07:32.610
Really? And here I was really
in the mood to do things.

00:07:33.219 --> 00:07:35.380
Very well, then.
Take care of the rest.

00:07:35.455 --> 00:07:37.082
Please leave
everything to us.

00:07:37.690 --> 00:07:39.920
Now then, Seiran.

00:07:39.992 --> 00:07:42.984
I've never held
a kitchen knife before.

00:07:43.062 --> 00:07:46.657
Maybe not kitchen knives,
but you have held swords, right?

00:07:46.966 --> 00:07:49.526
They're both blades,
so they're similar.

00:07:49.769 --> 00:07:52.738
At the very least, you should be
of more use than the Master.

00:07:53.139 --> 00:07:56.939
If not, I'll have you take care of
cleaning up this place.

00:07:57.510 --> 00:08:01.844
You know, I'm an officer of
much higher rank than yourself.

00:08:02.849 --> 00:08:04.874
Koyu, how are you at cooking?

00:08:04.951 --> 00:08:08.853
If it's simple, I should be able
to manage. And what about you?

00:08:09.655 --> 00:08:12.123
I've mastered
the innermost secrets of...

00:08:12.191 --> 00:08:14.421
...replacing roof tiles
and repairing the outer walls...

00:08:14.494 --> 00:08:16.291
...getting rid of pests
and bargaining for vegetables.

00:08:16.362 --> 00:08:19.763
Given those facts, I'd say that's
a rather foolish question to ask.

00:08:22.869 --> 00:08:24.461
Now then!

00:08:28.574 --> 00:08:32.476
She's sound asleep. Her face is
bright red. She looks pitiful.

00:08:34.480 --> 00:08:37.074
Just why do we have to
act like thieves...

00:08:37.149 --> 00:08:40.846
...and clamber over the wall
in order to visit your niece?!

00:08:41.220 --> 00:08:45.748
I still haven't been able to prepare
myself to tell her who I am.

00:08:45.825 --> 00:08:48.988
I'll go to the front entrance
and visit properly.

00:08:49.428 --> 00:08:53.364
You can hang around here
clinging like the dead shell of a cicada.

00:08:54.834 --> 00:08:57.997
How pompous.
Bringing orchids for her.

00:08:58.304 --> 00:09:02.502
It's normal to bring flowers to someone
who's not feeling well, is it not?

00:09:03.676 --> 00:09:07.476
What are you doing
in a place like this, Reishin?

00:09:07.547 --> 00:09:09.276
Oh? Secretary Kou, too?

00:09:09.348 --> 00:09:12.146
Ah, um, big brother,
um this... well...!

00:09:12.218 --> 00:09:17.349
You're so hopeless. But thank you
for coming to check on things.

00:09:17.423 --> 00:09:18.651
Come on in.

00:09:18.724 --> 00:09:19.918
You sure?

00:09:19.992 --> 00:09:23.189
I'm not about to leave two senior
secretaries out here to catch colds.

00:09:23.262 --> 00:09:26.060
Besides, I can't exactly ignore
my dear younger brother...

00:09:26.132 --> 00:09:28.100
...as he sits out here,
now can I?

00:09:29.535 --> 00:09:31.025
But, Reishin.

00:09:31.837 --> 00:09:32.804
Yes?

00:09:33.239 --> 00:09:35.867
Coming in through the window
is a bit...!

00:09:36.142 --> 00:09:37.871
S-Sorry!

00:09:38.077 --> 00:09:40.978
I was so happy,
that I got a bit carried away.

00:09:44.450 --> 00:09:48.216
I've brought flowers and herbal
medicine that boosts resistance.

00:09:48.287 --> 00:09:50.016
Why, thank you!

00:09:50.089 --> 00:09:51.113
Hey!

00:09:51.190 --> 00:09:53.283
How dare you make
your entrance ahead of me!

00:09:53.359 --> 00:09:54.986
Big brother! Me too!

00:09:57.163 --> 00:09:59.563
They say that fruit
is good for illness...

00:10:00.099 --> 00:10:02.897
...and I brought pretty much
every medicine we had.

00:10:03.235 --> 00:10:06.466
You brought too much.
Come on.

00:10:06.539 --> 00:10:08.871
As usual you run from
one extreme to the next.

00:10:08.941 --> 00:10:12.570
And why did you bring medicine to
improve virility and to fight constipation?

00:10:14.347 --> 00:10:16.975
I'll have the herbalist
beheaded immediately.

00:10:17.049 --> 00:10:18.846
Don't be so foolish!

00:10:18.918 --> 00:10:22.410
But I do appreciate
the sentiment, Reishin.

00:10:26.626 --> 00:10:29.754
It's been a while since
I last saw her from this close.

00:10:30.062 --> 00:10:32.530
You followed her around
during the summer.

00:10:32.598 --> 00:10:34.896
Even going so far as having her
call you Uncle.

00:10:34.967 --> 00:10:38.027
I really am her uncle, so there's
nothing wrong with that, is there?

00:10:38.104 --> 00:10:41.267
In comparison, you're her former boss.
In other words, a stranger.

00:10:41.340 --> 00:10:43.900
Shurei is yet to be married...

00:10:43.976 --> 00:10:46.444
...so I forbid you to come
any closer to her!

00:10:46.512 --> 00:10:48.537
Before getting carried away with
such pathetic conduct...

00:10:48.614 --> 00:10:52.516
...try to remember, your very existence
hasn't been acknowledged by her yet.

00:10:52.585 --> 00:10:53.609
Wha...!

00:10:54.086 --> 00:10:57.283
Master, we're done
with the meal preparations.

00:10:57.757 --> 00:10:59.725
Oh, thank you.
Well then...!

00:11:00.726 --> 00:11:02.023
Reishin!

00:11:02.094 --> 00:11:03.652
Wh-What are you
doing here?

00:11:03.729 --> 00:11:07.631
What's wrong with me, her uncle,
visiting my sick niece?

00:11:08.200 --> 00:11:10.930
In fact, it seems you've been
jumping the gun on things...

00:11:11.003 --> 00:11:13.972
...without my knowledge,
haven't you, Koyu?

00:11:14.040 --> 00:11:15.905
I'll deal with you later.

00:11:16.976 --> 00:11:19.410
I wouldn't be surprised if
he throws you out of the house.

00:11:23.449 --> 00:11:24.575
Huh?

00:11:25.017 --> 00:11:29.977
The Story of Saiunkoku

00:11:30.890 --> 00:11:34.792
I'm terribly sorry that our foolish son
has caused you so much trouble.

00:11:34.860 --> 00:11:37.988
It's all right.
Please don't worry about it.

00:11:39.732 --> 00:11:41.324
Is there something else?

00:11:41.867 --> 00:11:46.167
Well... about Ryushin...
did he happen to drop by here?

00:11:47.306 --> 00:11:50.002
When did you last see him?

00:11:50.409 --> 00:11:51.677
Shortly after noon.

00:11:51.677 --> 00:11:54.703
He said he was going to the mountain,
and hasn't been back since.

00:11:55.815 --> 00:11:57.112
I'll keep searching.

00:11:58.050 --> 00:11:59.347
One moment.

00:12:00.086 --> 00:12:04.113
Ryushin said he was going to
the mountain when he left, right?

00:12:04.190 --> 00:12:05.782
Y-Yes.

00:12:05.858 --> 00:12:07.985
If we're talking about a mountain
close to here...

00:12:08.060 --> 00:12:10.927
...perhaps he went to Mt. Ryu,
where madam's grave is.

00:12:10.996 --> 00:12:13.123
If it's Mt. Ryu,
we can get there by horse.

00:12:13.199 --> 00:12:15.690
We'll go back to the palace
and get some horses.

00:12:15.768 --> 00:12:17.668
Okay, then in the meantime...

00:12:17.737 --> 00:12:19.762
...I'll go to the
main Hong residence...

00:12:19.839 --> 00:12:21.807
...and get some protective gear
and torches ready.

00:12:23.509 --> 00:12:25.500
Do as you wish.

00:12:25.578 --> 00:12:29.378
But just remember, if you
get lost in the snowy mountains...

00:12:29.749 --> 00:12:33.048
...it doesn't matter how extensive your
knowledge, it'll essentially be useless.

00:12:33.853 --> 00:12:35.047
Yes.

00:12:38.657 --> 00:12:39.715
Reishin.

00:12:39.792 --> 00:12:41.760
The proper thing to say at a time
like this is...

00:12:41.827 --> 00:12:44.591
..."be careful and come back safely".

00:12:44.663 --> 00:12:46.392
Y-Yes, brother.

00:12:46.665 --> 00:12:50.157
What a thing to do to
the ever-so-shrewd Reishin.

00:12:51.003 --> 00:12:53.972
What's more,
he seems a bit happy.

00:12:54.907 --> 00:12:56.067
Seiran.

00:12:56.876 --> 00:13:01.813
Could you go with Koyu and help
carry the torches and protective gear?

00:13:01.881 --> 00:13:02.973
Yes!

00:13:03.048 --> 00:13:05.710
While I appreciate the sentiment,
General Ran,

00:13:05.785 --> 00:13:07.582
...right now,
time is of the essence.

00:13:07.920 --> 00:13:10.115
Let's borrow horses
from the main Hong residence.

00:13:10.189 --> 00:13:11.656
Very well.

00:13:11.724 --> 00:13:14.557
My home is closer to Mt. Ryu.

00:13:14.627 --> 00:13:17.289
If you find the child,
you should take him there.

00:13:17.363 --> 00:13:19.854
In that case,
we'll be off to the Hong house.

00:13:24.537 --> 00:13:27.870
Koyu and the others went to
all the trouble of preparing this meal...

00:13:27.940 --> 00:13:29.271
...but it's gone cold.

00:13:32.611 --> 00:13:38.516
If necessary, I'll go. So there's no
chance of anything happening to Koyu.

00:13:39.585 --> 00:13:41.018
Don't worry.

00:13:41.754 --> 00:13:43.915
Rather than have you go out...

00:13:43.989 --> 00:13:46.150
...I'll immediately have people from
the Hong family...

00:13:46.225 --> 00:13:47.783
...sent to conduct a search.

00:13:48.127 --> 00:13:53.292
Bell pepper pork. It's a bit watery,
but well made for a first timer.

00:13:54.133 --> 00:13:56.829
I don't want you
to do anything anymore.

00:13:56.902 --> 00:13:59.200
It doesn't matter what
the goal is.

00:13:59.438 --> 00:14:04.171
I just want you and Shurei
to live happily and peacefully.

00:14:05.544 --> 00:14:09.002
Thanks to you keeping me
assigned to the archives...

00:14:09.081 --> 00:14:12.812
...I've been able to read books I like
as often as I like...

00:14:12.885 --> 00:14:15.911
...and live happily and quietly
for the past ten years.

00:14:15.988 --> 00:14:17.216
I'm grateful.

00:14:17.289 --> 00:14:18.916
It's only been ten years!

00:14:18.991 --> 00:14:21.516
And it was neither quiet
nor peaceful.

00:14:22.161 --> 00:14:25.324
When I learned that you'd gone
to find the exiled prince...

00:14:25.664 --> 00:14:30.260
...I sent assassins to eliminate
the previous king a number of times.

00:14:33.005 --> 00:14:35.599
But your efforts were thwarted
by Advisor Sho every time, right?

00:14:35.674 --> 00:14:39.235
Yeah. Just what is that?
Some raccoon spirit?

00:14:41.046 --> 00:14:45.210
So much for his promise to have you
live peacefully. That big liar!

00:14:45.651 --> 00:14:49.519
He used you to the very end!
Putting a major burden on you!

00:14:50.189 --> 00:14:52.714
It was all by my own will.

00:14:52.791 --> 00:14:55.624
These bloody hands
aren't anyone else's fault.

00:14:57.563 --> 00:15:00.225
Thank you for always worrying
so much about me.

00:15:00.766 --> 00:15:04.759
I'm very lucky to have
such adorable younger brothers.

00:15:06.205 --> 00:15:09.197
Regardless of what Kuro might have
you think, he also worries about us.

00:15:10.876 --> 00:15:14.607
But more importantly, I want you to
properly introduce yourself to Shurei.

00:15:15.047 --> 00:15:16.639
But, big brother.

00:15:16.715 --> 00:15:19.684
Shurei must think
I'm a bad person.

00:15:20.052 --> 00:15:23.215
No doubt she thinks I'm a cruel villain of
an uncle, having thrown you out...

00:15:23.289 --> 00:15:26.816
...and cutting all ties with you, and then
taking over as head of the family.

00:15:27.760 --> 00:15:31.059
"You're the worst possible uncle.
I despise your kind."

00:15:31.563 --> 00:15:33.588
To think of her saying
that to me!

00:15:35.734 --> 00:15:38.999
Reishin, what do you think?
Isn't our daughter cute?

00:15:40.072 --> 00:15:44.133
Your niece carries my blood
and Shoka's, and yours as well.

00:15:45.577 --> 00:15:49.013
Shurei doesn't yet know
the depths of your spite...

00:15:49.081 --> 00:15:53.780
...your utter self-conceit,
or your extreme selfishness.

00:15:55.254 --> 00:15:57.518
You can start by practicing
your smile.

00:15:57.589 --> 00:16:01.116
If you smile nicely,
then Shurei will smile back...

00:16:01.193 --> 00:16:03.161
...so you should
start practicing right away.

00:16:10.769 --> 00:16:12.794
You know, Reishin.

00:16:12.871 --> 00:16:16.932
It would be nice if one day everyone
in this family could find happiness.

00:16:26.986 --> 00:16:28.613
This isn't looking good.

00:16:28.988 --> 00:16:32.947
Ryushin may be reckless, but he
always has a reason for his actions.

00:16:33.859 --> 00:16:37.056
In this case, his reason for coming to a
snowy mountain now would likely be...!

00:16:37.363 --> 00:16:38.625
Medicinal herbs!

00:16:39.098 --> 00:16:43.467
Then we should focus our search
on places where medicinal herbs grow.

00:16:44.103 --> 00:16:45.297
Let's go.

00:16:46.638 --> 00:16:50.096
I seriously did practice smiling.

00:16:50.175 --> 00:16:52.541
You didn't improve much,
did you?

00:16:53.312 --> 00:16:56.406
Why are only the Senior Secretary
of Civil Affairs and Shoka here?

00:16:56.849 --> 00:16:59.317
Well, never mind that.
My purpose here is...!

00:17:06.358 --> 00:17:07.325
She's hot.

00:17:21.673 --> 00:17:23.573
Shurei gave me this.

00:17:47.733 --> 00:17:49.701
That was a gift from me.

00:17:51.603 --> 00:17:52.695
It's okay.

00:17:52.771 --> 00:17:54.204
I can still wait.

00:17:56.508 --> 00:17:57.873
Water...!

00:17:57.943 --> 00:17:59.240
W-Water?

00:17:59.545 --> 00:18:01.035
Water... Water...!

00:18:03.082 --> 00:18:06.210
It's not good for Shurei
to get sick too often.

00:18:08.087 --> 00:18:13.047
To think that a sick woman
is so unguarded and defenseless!

00:18:13.425 --> 00:18:15.052
It's torture!

00:18:17.930 --> 00:18:20.057
N-Not good. The medicine...!

00:18:26.138 --> 00:18:28.800
Given the situation,
this should be forgivable.

00:18:50.295 --> 00:18:51.785
Shurei! What's wrong?!

00:18:54.500 --> 00:18:56.593
Ah, well... you see...!

00:18:59.972 --> 00:19:01.405
- Ryushin!
- Ryushin!

00:19:01.473 --> 00:19:02.599
Ryushin!

00:19:05.644 --> 00:19:07.441
Seiran! Shuei!

00:19:23.362 --> 00:19:26.126
I told them I didn't do anything.

00:19:26.932 --> 00:19:31.460
You had her drink the master's special
ginger tea with no ginger, didn't you?

00:19:32.838 --> 00:19:35.306
Never mind that,
how's Ryushin doing?

00:19:35.807 --> 00:19:38.640
He's being treated at
Secretary Kou's residence.

00:19:39.011 --> 00:19:42.811
His hands and feet were slightly
frostbitten, but there's no need to worry.

00:19:43.248 --> 00:19:45.478
That boy.
Being so reckless.

00:19:46.018 --> 00:19:51.547
I see that your fever's gone down a bit.
Although it's a bit of a shame.

00:19:52.090 --> 00:19:56.026
You were very lovely and attractive
with cheeks flushed like peaches.

00:19:57.629 --> 00:20:01.065
Go stick your head in a snow bank
and stay frozen until spring.

00:20:01.133 --> 00:20:02.498
You Casanova!

00:20:03.168 --> 00:20:04.465
My lady?

00:20:04.536 --> 00:20:07.369
I'm gonna go check on
how Ryushin's doing.

00:20:07.439 --> 00:20:08.667
However...!

00:20:09.408 --> 00:20:11.376
But I'm worried.

00:20:14.413 --> 00:20:15.880
Ryushin!

00:20:15.948 --> 00:20:19.179
He insisted on coming to see you
and wouldn't listen.

00:20:19.618 --> 00:20:21.677
Miss Shurei.
I'm sorry.

00:20:23.722 --> 00:20:25.189
Ryushin.

00:20:26.225 --> 00:20:29.194
Teacher. You'd said that
you'd be taking a break...

00:20:29.261 --> 00:20:31.354
...from teaching at the temple, right?

00:20:31.430 --> 00:20:36.561
But I heard from the head monk!
That you might not be coming back at all!

00:20:37.836 --> 00:20:40.202
I'd been doing my homework.

00:20:40.439 --> 00:20:42.964
But if I handed it in,
then that would be the end of it.

00:20:43.041 --> 00:20:45.874
I didn't mean to cause trouble,
but I...!

00:20:47.346 --> 00:20:49.644
I'm sorry to have
put you through all that.

00:20:50.549 --> 00:20:53.950
Teacher.
Don't get married!

00:20:54.219 --> 00:20:55.880
M-Married?!

00:20:56.255 --> 00:21:01.488
In another five years,
I'll become as good a man as Seiran!

00:21:01.560 --> 00:21:03.221
Just a minute there, boy!

00:21:03.295 --> 00:21:05.286
Just give me another five years
and I, too...!

00:21:07.232 --> 00:21:08.563
Wh-What the...?

00:21:09.434 --> 00:21:10.731
A fan?

00:21:10.802 --> 00:21:12.394
Why'd that come flying in here?

00:21:14.039 --> 00:21:17.202
Oh my, Your Majesty,
I'm very sorry.

00:21:17.276 --> 00:21:19.244
It slipped from my hand.

00:21:22.948 --> 00:21:24.415
Ryushin.

00:21:24.483 --> 00:21:27.919
Your father's very worried
so you should go home now.

00:21:28.453 --> 00:21:31.786
Thank you for gathering
herbs for Shurei.

00:21:32.224 --> 00:21:33.248
Sure.

00:21:33.525 --> 00:21:37.621
Take care of your health. When you're
fully recovered, I'll send camellias.

00:21:38.830 --> 00:21:40.263
Thank you very much.

00:21:41.166 --> 00:21:42.633
I'll see you to your home.

00:21:44.469 --> 00:21:47.267
Reishin. You're not doing
anyone any favors...

00:21:47.339 --> 00:21:49.933
...by acting like
an ornament out here.

00:21:50.475 --> 00:21:53.069
Uncle. I'm your uncle.

00:21:53.845 --> 00:21:56.905
I've been watching over you
from the shadows throughout the years.

00:21:56.982 --> 00:21:58.279
We're going.

00:21:59.818 --> 00:22:01.615
Well then,
we'll be going too.

00:22:01.687 --> 00:22:03.382
Take care of yourself, Shurei.

00:22:03.455 --> 00:22:04.922
You two.

00:22:04.990 --> 00:22:07.117
The kitchen
still needs cleaning up.

00:22:10.062 --> 00:22:12.792
We can't ask that of
General Ran and Koyu.

00:22:13.332 --> 00:22:15.100
It's all right, Shurei.

00:22:15.100 --> 00:22:17.068
Don't worry about it and
get some rest.

00:22:17.135 --> 00:22:20.298
I-I'll help too!
I'm sure I'll be useful!

00:22:20.672 --> 00:22:22.731
Thank you very much, Your Majesty.

00:22:23.075 --> 00:22:27.068
No doubt, scrubbing pots will
be of some use to you one day.

00:22:27.779 --> 00:22:29.337
In that case, I will...!

00:22:29.414 --> 00:22:31.609
Please retire
for the evening, Master.

00:22:38.957 --> 00:22:44.361
If only a kind, beautiful person
would become your consort.

00:22:45.864 --> 00:22:49.265
Although you draw closer with
your strong desires for me, I...!

00:22:51.236 --> 00:22:56.173
Do you honestly think I'll ever
come to call you "husband of mine"?

00:22:56.875 --> 00:22:59.435
Falling in love with the one
you're supposed to kill?

00:22:59.511 --> 00:23:02.674
Who's ever heard of
such a dimwitted assassin?

00:23:04.783 --> 00:23:07.809
Hey, Shoka. I love you.

00:23:08.453 --> 00:23:13.516
Shurei and Seiran are so cute.
I'm truly so very fortunate.

00:23:18.296 --> 00:23:22.357
It seems there's no medicine
for lovesickness.

00:23:30.509 --> 00:23:35.606
You've always led a very carefree life
and right now

00:23:35.747 --> 00:23:42.311
Amidst this rain
what sort of dreams are you chasing?

00:23:42.421 --> 00:23:47.484
And while you are fighting
loneliness somewhere

00:23:47.592 --> 00:23:52.586
You must be holding back
the tears too

00:23:53.665 --> 00:23:58.125
You say you'll be fine alone

00:23:59.671 --> 00:24:04.802
You are just like me

00:24:05.544 --> 00:24:10.072
Even if we have to take
the longer way around

00:24:10.148 --> 00:24:16.053
We somehow still prefer this route

00:24:17.022 --> 00:24:22.824
Whenever I feel happy or glad

00:24:22.928 --> 00:24:27.797
I will always think of you

00:24:28.934 --> 00:24:41.608
I believe that the colorful seasons will
deliver this feeling of mine to you

00:24:45.016 --> 00:24:45.884
Next Episode

00:24:45.884 --> 00:24:48.086
Next Episode
This is the last time I'll be taking on
those little jobs at Kogarou...

